# Project documentation

Before modifying **Keycloak auth, RBAC roles, or OpenTelemetry**:

1. Read the relevant guide under [`docs/`](../../docs/):
   - [docs/RBAC_GUIDE.md](../../docs/RBAC_GUIDE.md) / [docs/RBAC_QUICK_START.md](../../docs/RBAC_QUICK_START.md) — roles and authorization
   - [docs/KEYCLOAK_RBAC_SETUP.md](../../docs/KEYCLOAK_RBAC_SETUP.md) — Keycloak realm/client setup
   - [docs/OPENTELEMETRY.md](../../docs/OPENTELEMETRY.md) — OTel exporter, collector, Jaeger

After behavior changes, update in the same PR:

- Matching docs under `docs/` when auth, roles, or observability behavior changed
- [documentation-standards.mdc](documentation-standards.mdc) doc map if paths or scope changed
- `make swagger-load` + commit spec files when `/api/v1` HTTP surface changed
